OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist ship to join search for
OL,4,Amissing fishermen and boat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA specialist ship is to be used in the
OL,7,Fsearch for two missing fishermen and
OL,8,Ftheir boat off the coast of Lewis.
OL,10,FNorman "Tam" Murray, 40 and Murdo
OL,11,FMorrison, 23, were on board the Kilda
OL,12,Fwhen it disappeared on 13 October.
OL,14,FThe body of crewmate Douglas Craigie,
OL,15,F49, was recovered from the sea in the
OL,16,Fearly hours of the following morning by
OL,17,Frescuers.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
